    "caption": "In the 15th episode of Hub Talks, we dive into the potential of the MENA region as a Blue Ocean for Startups. 🌍💡\n\nJoin us as we explore how the rapidly evolving technologies and government support in MENA countries create incredible opportunities for ambitious startups from Central Asia and the Caucasus.\n\nOur special guests:\n🚀 Aslan Sultanov — Managing Partner at White Hill Capital & CEO of Al-Farabi Innovation Hub\n🚀 Yousef Alsayed — CEO & Co-founder of AILA\n\nHosted by Madi Tazhikenov\n\nThis episode is packed with insights on:\n• Key success factors for conquering the MENA region 🌟\n• How government backing and tech advancements are fueling growth 🔥\n• Inspirational stories and advice for budding entrepreneurs 🌱\n\nDon’t miss this chance to unlock new horizons and learn from the best! Subscribe, like, and stay tuned for more inspiring conversations! 🎧",
